# Switches for unattended soak runs (soak.ps1), all inert unless set.
# OPENSTRIKERS_MATCH_SECONDS overrides the game duration so a run reaches the
# final whistle and recaps quickly. OPENSTRIKERS_AI_SKILL (0 Training .. 4
# Legend) is the host's soak_diff, so the AI scores often and drives the goal,
# replay and celebration paths. The HUD logs one 'openstrikers: score L-R' line
# per scoreline change so a run's log says how many goals it went through.
--- a/src/Game/GameTweaks.cpp
